<https://decision-cli.dev/ns/ex/EX-FILESYSTEM-GREP> <https://decision-cli.dev/ns#basedOnApprovedResult> <https://decision-cli.dev/ns/result/VGR-015> <https://decision-cli.dev/ns/graph/catalog> .
<https://decision-cli.dev/ns/ex/EX-FILESYSTEM-GREP> <https://decision-cli.dev/ns#rationale> "Pattern for asserting absence: search the repo for a forbidden symbol and assert exit 1 (no matches). Form: `find <dir> -name '*.py' -exec grep -l '<symbol>' {} \\;` with `dec:expectExitCode 1`. Use when the TC claims a cleanup/removal happened (e.g. \"no hardcoded model names remain in workers/\")." <https://decision-cli.dev/ns/graph/catalog> .
<https://decision-cli.dev/ns/ex/EX-FILESYSTEM-GREP> <https://decision-cli.dev/ns#patternName> "filesystem-negative-grep" <https://decision-cli.dev/ns/graph/catalog> .
<https://decision-cli.dev/ns/ex/EX-FILESYSTEM-GREP> <https://decision-cli.dev/ns#appliesToSafetyClass> "isolated" <https://decision-cli.dev/ns/graph/catalog> .
<https://decision-cli.dev/ns/ex/EX-FILESYSTEM-GREP> <https://decision-cli.dev/ns#exemplarOf> <https://decision-cli.dev/ns/graph/VG-008> <https://decision-cli.dev/ns/graph/catalog> .
<https://decision-cli.dev/ns/ex/EX-FILESYSTEM-GREP> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://decision-cli.dev/ns#ExemplarGraph> <https://decision-cli.dev/ns/graph/catalog> .
<https://decision-cli.dev/oxi-events/ns/mutation/c8272684-a366-413f-88a1-9ab914ef7f19> <https://decision-cli.dev/oxi-events/ns#committedAt> "2026-05-27T08:04:58.661313875Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://decision-cli.dev/oxi-events/ns/meta> .
